_NET←Init mode;use
:If 9=⎕NC '_EWE'
    →0 ⊣ _NET←_EWE
:EndIf

:If 0=⎕NC 'PATH'
    PATH←{¯1↓1⊃⎕NPARTS ⍵}⍣2⊢4⊃5179⌶⊃⎕SI ⍝ Parent of where this function was loaded from?
    PATH[⍸PATH='/']←'\'
:EndIf


:Select ⎕C mode
:Case 'npoi'
    use←(⊂''),(',',DllPath)¨'NPOI.Core' 'NPOI.OOXML' 'ArrayEWE.Helpers'
:Case 'gembox'
    use←(⊂''),(',',DllPath)¨'GemBox.Spreadsheet' 'ArrayEWE.Helpers'
:Else
    'Supported are NPOI and GemBox' ⎕SIGNAL 11
:EndSelect

(_NET←⎕NS'').⎕USING←use
_NET.ArrayEWE.Helpers.WorksheetExtension.Initialize
_EWE←_NET
